"\n","#  COUNTPlot OF HOUSESTYLE\n","\n","plt.figure(figsize=(10, 5))\n","\n","sns.countplot(\n","    data=df,\n","    x=\"HouseStyle\",\n","    order=df[\"HouseStyle\"].value_counts().index\n",")\n","\n","plt.title(\"Distribution of House Styles\")\n","plt.xlabel(\"House Style\")\n","plt.ylabel(\"Number of Houses\")\n","\n","plt.xticks(rotation=45)\n","plt.tight_layout()\n","\n","plt.show()\n"],"metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":507},"id":"MNQl7KQ8vyI2","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1795409566519,"user_tz":-330,"elapsed":199,"user":{"displayName":"Pushkar Thombare","userId":"03985106605329084109"}},"outputId":"54219278-bc91-47f9-d3cd-16293373f882"},"execution_count":33,"outputs":[{"output_type":"display_data","data":{"text/plain":["<Figure size 1000x500 with 1 Axes>"],"image/png":"\n"},"metadata":{}}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["\n","### Distribution Analysis - Key Findings\n","\n","1. The SalePrice histogram helps identify the distribution and skewness of house prices.\n","\n","2. The SalePrice boxplot helps identify the median, spread, and potential outliers.\n","\n","3. The log transformation helps compare the original and transformed price distributions.\n","\n","4. The OverallQual boxplot helps examine how selling prices vary across quality ratings.\n","\n","5. The Neighborhood boxplot helps compare house prices across different locations.\n","\n","6. The OverallQual countplot shows the frequency of each quality rating.\n","\n","7. The HouseStyle countplot shows the frequency of different house styles.\n","\n","### Conclusion\n","\n","Distribution analysis provides a visual understanding\n","of house prices, property quality, neighborhood\n","differences, and house styles in the Ames Housing Dataset.\n"],"metadata":{"id":"FQJZA8AIwDgk"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["\n","## Correlation and Covariance\n","\n","### Calculate Covariance and Correlation\n","\n","Covariance and correlation matrices are calc